    "description": {
      "value": "<p class=\"feature\"><em>Strength Saving Throw:</em> DC [[lookup @save.dc.value activity=t4WdQWTV3tN4xcdO]], [[lookup @target.affects.special activity=t4WdQWTV3tN4xcdO]] the [[lookup @name lowercase]] can see within [[lookup @range.value activity=t4WdQWTV3tN4xcdO]] [[lookup @range.units activity=t4WdQWTV3tN4xcdO]]. <em>Failure:</em> The target is pulled up to [[lookup @target.template.size activity=t4WdQWTV3tN4xcdO]] [[lookup @target.template.units activity=t4WdQWTV3tN4xcdO]]. straight toward the [[lookup @name lowercase]] and has the &amp;Reference[Grappled apply=false] condition (escape DC [[lookup @skills.ath.passive]]) from one of six roots. Until the grapple ends, the target takes [[/damage average]] damage at the start of each of its turns.</p>",
